OL,3,GNEWSAPolice search land for woman
OL,4,Amurdered in 1995
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are excavating an area of land
OL,7,Fin South Yorkshire as they search for
OL,8,Fthe body of a woman who was murdered
OL,9,Fmore than 30 years ago.
OL,11,FTeresa Shephard, 26, from Basegreen in
OL,12,FSheffield, went missing in June 1995
OL,13,Fand although Worksop man Peter Turner
OL,14,Fwas jailed for her murder, her body has
OL,15,Fnever been found.
OL,17,FSouth Yorkshire Police said detectives
OL,18,Fwere searching a site of Piper Lane in
OL,19,FAston, Rotherham, and expected to be
OL,20,Fthere for the next few days.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
